{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "latam", "appid": 548430, "month": "2022-08", "window": 1, "start_date": 1659312000, "end_date": 1661990399, "month_true_total": 14, "quota": 14, "returned": 14, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:32:48 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "121544807", "author": {"steamid": "76561199011585724", "personaname": "Yuoly19", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199011585724/", "num_games_owned": 110, "num_reviews": 42, "playtime_forever": 44176, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 40891, "last_played": 1785557699, "avatar": "8bc3e81eb09cb7272a0c010028636b83995d809f"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Tomas a left 4 dead 2 y Payday 2, los mezclas y te sale este juego\n\nShooter por clases en donde cada una esta hecha con amor puro, escojes una y te vas a extinguir a la fauna local y de paso completar misiones.\n\nEl loop de juego es increible, y considerando que el juego esta hecho como multijugador el singleplayer es muy bueno!\n\nNo lo juego tanto como antes por falta de contenido, pero eso solo es un problema si al igual que yo no tienes vida y le sacas 600 horas a un juego de enanos.\n\n8/10 nunca supe quien era Karl", "timestamp_created": 1661983454, "timestamp_updated": 1772953009, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 19, "votes_funny": 5, "weighted_vote_score": "0.669955432415008545", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 4, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "121353817", "author": {"steamid": "76561198166339422", "personaname": "paramus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/paramus/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 38, "playtime_forever": 2062, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1574, "last_played": 1745640353, "avatar": "ec2f166d5fd7e51e83160b1058d8b1e1d8039f70"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Serán menos enanos que los demás.", "timestamp_created": 1661662315, "timestamp_updated": 1661662315, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "120893654", "author": {"steamid": "76561198454284200", "personaname": "Destro", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198454284200/", "num_games_owned": 169, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 5708, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1252, "last_played": 1751878149, "avatar": "090159eb91f64a67056efb6db7f6b6493038f74d"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Un hermoso juego cooperativo en el cual podrás destiltearte de juegos de mierda como el lol, posee un mecanismo de generación de cueva de forma procedural, lo que quiere decir esto que cada cueva a la que vayas va a ser distinta a otra, nunca te vas a encontrar 2 iguales. Por otro lado tiene 4 clases (hasta ahora el día que hice esta reseña) que cada uno tiene sus armas propias que puedes ir desbloqueando solo jugando, puntos de habilidades pasivas y activas que podrás elegir las que mas te gusten según tu modo de juego. Hablando de que este juego es un shooter se podría decir que los disparos son muy buenos, el sonido esta cuidado al milímetro y hay bastante variedad de enemigos ya sean los extraterrestres o los robots llamados \"rivales\". Muchos tipos de misiones distintas, encargos semanales y mas a late game un contenido mucho mas difícil. En fin si te gusta los juegos tipo Warframe, Left 4 dead, Killing floor, Minecraft, compralo no te vas a arrepentir :)", "timestamp_created": 1660926808, "timestamp_updated": 1660926808, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.528795838356018066", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "120758451", "author": {"steamid": "76561198390386090", "personaname": "René Descartes", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Maradona10/", "num_games_owned": 373, "num_reviews": 194, "playtime_forever": 5781, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3146, "last_played": 1758335985, "avatar": "86cd75fc200fe2ee02f4f75feb8c3e7ce1dc6bc3"}, "language": "latam", "review": "diggy hole\n", "timestamp_created": 1660698767, "timestamp_updated": 1715486481, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "120715552", "author": {"steamid": "76561198202641006", "personaname": "Rattman", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/WaifuTruco/", "num_games_owned": 160, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 6340, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4198, "last_played": 1770943722, "avatar": "d3eb39d70f297a4191bea908797cd7972a77ad86"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Rock and Stone", "timestamp_created": 1660635016, "timestamp_updated": 1660635016, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "120655032", "author": {"steamid": "76561198119622021", "pe