"review": "Nice game :)", "timestamp_created": 1660278054, "timestamp_updated": 1660278054, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "120422665", "author": {"steamid": "76561198336722948", "personaname": "LaAspid", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198336722948/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 28150, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1334, "last_played": 1752019421, "avatar": "d5f56013be58d0495b09e2a0ed24b17188d4f996"}, "language": "latam", "review": "De los mejores juegos que tuve el placer de jugar, los devs le meten muchísimo amor y actualizaciones. La comunidad no es para nada tóxica y se puede jugar re bien con randoms.", "timestamp_created": 1660185204, "timestamp_updated": 1700609069, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.53125", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "120369618", "author": {"steamid": "76561198313114370", "personaname": "Zaygno", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198313114370/", "num_games_owned": 169, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 4870, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4379, "last_played": 1719180224, "avatar": "02e783ab1a4ff914833d9c8c54da19a07641470f"}, "language": "latam", "review": "TOTALMENTE UN SI, esta lleno de detalles y mimos por todas partes lo unico es cuando las fisicas te disparan a la loma del orto en ciertas ocasiones, pero en si es un juegaso, osea son enanos peronistas mineros ya esta pa no necesitas mas", "timestamp_created": 1660100485, "timestamp_updated": 1660100485, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "120278461", "author": {"steamid": "76561199233879828", "personaname": "paur144", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199233879828/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 25536, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2432, "last_played": 1783550027, "avatar": "6ed1c40e53b674f6dbdaeea83eaaa788dea554a6"}, "language": "latam", "review": "El juego esta muy bien de precio , aun mas si lo encuentras en oferta. Me gusta su comunidad por que es muy sana, cave recalcar que el juego me corre en una pc de gama baja gracias a una guia de optimizacion que encontre  en la comunidad. \nLa jugabilidad se disfruta mas si estas en compania ya que no se hace tan tediosa la recogida de minerales, aun asi puedes jugar en solitario llendo acompañado de un compañero quete proporciona el juego.", "timestamp_created": 1659967437, "timestamp_updated": 1659967437, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "120209850", "author": {"steamid": "76561198438430600", "personaname": "Kuku", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/MarconiDidNothingWrong/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 139, "playtime_forever": 18744, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2724, "last_played": 1779590903, "avatar": "b5b9f67d71cf7f93c782feb52fb7f5c890e9dcde"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Your ♥♥♥♥ Fantastic. Danger. Darkness. ♥♥♥♥. Rival Ejaculation Season 2\nPRESS ANY KEY TO CONTINUE", "timestamp_created": 1659864855, "timestamp_updated": 1659864855, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "120121107", "author": {"steamid": "76561198025491782", "personaname": "YezzR", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/GilFreeman/", "num_games_owned": 275, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 27679, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4972, "last_played": 1786684862, "avatar": "b716a5e8b10f94ab14ad9b44677227bddc5fa509"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Un juego bastante bueno, rejugable y escuchar a los enanos discutir y decirse de cosas hace que salgan buenas carcajadas; anexa a eso UNAS BUENAS CERVEZAS PARA JUGAR TOTALMENTE EBRIO (por supuesto, no abuse de la bebida en exceso)\n\nPuedes jugarlo en solitario pero a mayores niveles de dificultad es mejor ir acompañado de amigos o desconocidos.\n\nSon 4 enanos con habilidades muy diferentes entre ellos, las cuales se complementan y hacen de un equipo (SI SE SABEN COORDINAR) IMPARABLE contra oleadas inmensas de Insectos y hasta Robots de la Compañia Enemiga.\n\nAnimate a comprarlo y nos vemos en el juego!\n\n¡ROCK AAAND STOOOONEEE!", "timestamp_created": 1659725331, "timestamp_updated": 1659725331, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.582309544086456299", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactio